o track; every kind by default. Leaving one out doesn’t","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"stop the rest of the work: the version is still saved, and the records still made","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"durable on backgrounding.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"name":"version","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The version the app runs at now; the bundle’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"CFBundleShortVersionString"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"by default. "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nil"},{"type":"text","text":" tracks neither installs nor updates, and saves nothing."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"name":"versionStore","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Where the version is kept from one launch to the next; a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/FileVersionStore"},{"type":"text","text":" in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SegmentStore.defaultDirectory"},{"type":"text","text":" by default."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"name":"notificationCenter","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Where the platform posts its lifecycle notifications; the default","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"center by default.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"name":"file","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The caller’s file; leave it to its default."}]}]},{"name":"fileID","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The caller’s module and file name; leave it to its default."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"name":"function","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The caller’s enclosing declaration; leave it to its default."}]}]},{"name":"line","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The caller’s line; leave it to its default."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"name":"column","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The caller’s column; leave it to its default."}]}]}]},{"content":[{"text":"Return Value","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"return-value"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The observation, which tracks until it is cancelled, finished or released.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"},{"content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","text":"Discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Nothing is tracked until this is called. Call it as the app launches, such as in its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"application delegate’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"application(_:didFinishLaunchingWithOptions:)"},{"type":"text","text":", and keep what it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"returns:"}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["lifecycle = tracker.trackLifecycle()"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"As it starts, it compares ","type":"text"},{"code":"version","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" with the one ","type":"text"},{"code":"versionStore","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" saved: none tracks an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"install, another an update, the same neither; it then saves ","type":"text"},{"code":"version","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". Then it tracks an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"open, not from the background. After that, each transition tracks once, however many times","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"it is reported:","type":"text"}]},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"iOS, iPadOS, tvOS, visionOS and Mac Catalyst: ","type":"text"},{"code":"UIApplication","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"’s notifications. Entering","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the background tracks ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/ApplicationBackgrounded","type":"reference"},{"text":", returning to the foreground","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/ApplicationOpened","type":"reference"},{"text":" from the background, and terminating ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/ApplicationTerminated","type":"reference"},{"text":".","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"A scene-based app gets them once for the whole app, not per scene.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"watchOS: "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"WKApplication"},{"type":"text","text":"‘s, without termination, which watchOS doesn’t report."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"macOS: "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSApplication"},{"type":"text","text":"’s. Another app becoming active counts as the background, this"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"one becoming active again as the foreground."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Linux: no notifications; ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/LifecycleObservation\/finish()","isActive":true},{"text":" tracks the termination.","type":"text"}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Leaving the foreground, it also makes the tracker’s records durable: it waits for the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"tracker’s worker to write every record tracked so far to the tracker’s store, then calls","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the store’s ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"synchronize()"},{"text":". A delivery batched with ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/LifecycleBatchStrategy","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" sends what","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"is pending as it reads the ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/ApplicationBackgrounded","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" record. A notification’s handler only","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"hands the transition on; the tracking, the version store and the store’s work run on a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"task of their own, never on the thread that posted it. Where the system suspends an app in the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"background (all but macOS and Mac Catalyst), the handler asks it for background time","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ProcessInfo.performExpiringActivity"},{"text":"), held until the records are durable. A termination’s records are made durable the same way, without","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"holding the main thread up: what the process doesn’t finish before it exits is what the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"tracker’s documented loss window takes.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"It keeps no state outside what it returns. Two calls observe twice, so call it once per","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"tracker.","type":"text"}]}],"kind":"content"}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/Trackers\/Tracker\/trackLifecycle(kinds:version:versionStore:notificationCenter:file:fileID:function:line:column:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Tracks the app’s lifecycle through this tracker until the observation it returns is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"cancelled, finished or released: "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/LifecycleTrack